{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659084385,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da046739001n5p2TDSd9LZlca","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da044e4c001f4TJa08VACzO3o","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-bcbbcd5bfd56237f","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"openQuestions\":[],\"resolvedQuestions\":[],\"keyFindings\":[],\"ruledOutDirections\":[],\"metrics\":{\"iterationsCompleted\":0,\"openQuestions\":0,\"resolvedQuestions\":0,\"keyFindings\":0,\"convergenceScore\":0,\"coverageBySources\":{}}}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/findings-registry.json"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/findings-registry.json","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/findings-registry.json"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"resolvedQuestions\\\":[],\\\"keyFindings\\\":[],\\\"ruledOutDirections\\\":[],\\\"metrics\\\":{\\\"iterationsCompleted\\\":0,\\\"openQuestions\\\":0,\\\"resolvedQuestions\\\":0,\\\"keyFindings\\\":0,\\\"convergenceScore\\\":0,\\\"coverageBySources\\\":{}}}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/findings-registry.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794659084089,"end":1794659084385}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659084403,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da04566e002uYUwY6qJVFnRWQ","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da044e4c001f4TJa08VACzO3o","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6aeea317f511afe","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Research Strategy - Mistral Vibe as a cli-external-orchestration runtime\ndescription: Session tracking for the devpass-deepseek lineage of the Mistral Vibe runtime-mode research run.\nimportance_tier: normal\ncontextType: planning\n---\n\n# Deep Research Strategy - Mistral Vibe runtime mode\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this lineage. Records what to investigate, what worked, what failed, and where to focus next. Read at every iteration.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Init populated Topic, Key Questions, Known Context and Research Boundaries.\n- Per iteration: the agent reads Next Focus, writes iteration evidence, and the reducer refreshes What Worked/Failed, answered questions, carried-forward questions, ruled-out directions and Next Focus.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nMistral Vibe (vibe 3.1.2, installed) as a governed cli-external-orchestration runtime mode, and feature parity of its extensions, hooks, plugins, skills, commands and agents with cli-opencode. Work the eight angles in `research-angles.md`, one per iteration, using `research/evidence/vibe-help.txt` as the captured headless contract.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\n\n- [ ] How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\n- [ ] Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\n- [ ] What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\n- [ ] For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\n- [ ] What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Building any part of the `cli-mistral-vibe` mode. This run writes findings and a ranked phase plan only.\n- Writing the operator's `~/.vibe/` directory or any credential value.\n- Re-implementing Vibe features speculatively; every parity claim must name a Vibe source location or a live command capture.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- All eight research angles answered with cited evidence and a parity table, or `maxIterations` (8) reached.\n- A hard blocker on the Vibe source (package not readable) makes the source-based angles `UNKNOWN`; record it and continue with the captured CLI contract.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\n\n[None yet -- populated as iterations answer questions]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\n\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without success]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n[Approaches investigated and definitively eliminated]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n## 10A. SATURATED DIRECTIONS AND DIVERGENCE FRONTIER\n\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Saturated: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n## 11A. CARRIED-FORWARD OPEN QUESTIONS\n\n[None yet]\n<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n\nAngle 1: headless dispatch contract - read the installed Vibe CLI entrypoint and headless runner, then confirm against `research/evidence/vibe-help.txt`.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n## 12. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\nPopulated at init from the packet's own docs and the live install.\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Source pointers: installed package at `~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe` (version 3.1.2, console scripts `vibe`, `vibe-acp`, `vibe-app-server`); repo runtime packets under `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-*/`.\n- Captured evidence: `specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt` (vibe 3.1.2 `--help`, `vibe-acp --help`, `vibe-app-server --help`).\n- Packet context: `spec.md` (three phases, read-only research scope), `research-angles.md` (eight angles and the evidence rules), `plan.md`, `goal.md`.\n- Integration points: `runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts` (nine executor kinds), `runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs` (command builders and model allowlists), `runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs` (state gateway), `.opencode/` plugin and agent surfaces.\n- Constraints: read-only research; at most two live smoke dispatches shaped as a one-turn `OK` in a temp working directory; never read or print a key value.\n\n---\n\n## 13. RESEARCH BOUNDARIES\n\n- Max iterations: 8\n- Convergence threshold: 0.05\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Progressive synthesis: true\n- research/research.md ownership: workflow-owned canonical synthesis output\n- Lifecycle branches: `resume`, `restart` (live); `fork`, `completed-continue` (deferred)\n- Machine-owned sections: reducer controls Sections 3, 6, 7-11A\n- Question injection surface: `{spec_folder}/research/inbox.jsonl`\n- Canonical pause sentinel: `research/.deep-research-pause`\n- Current generation: 1\n- Started: 2026-11-14T12:24:30Z\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"---\\ntitle: Deep Research Strategy - Mistral Vibe as a cli-external-orchestration runtime\\ndescription: Session tracking for the devpass-deepseek lineage of the Mistral Vibe runtime-mode research run.\\nimportance_tier: normal\\ncontextType: planning\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Research Strategy - Mistral Vibe runtime mode\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for this lineage. Records what to investigate, what worked, what failed, and where to focus next. Read at every iteration.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Init populated Topic, Key Questions, Known Context and Research Boundaries.\\n- Per iteration: the agent reads Next Focus, writes iteration evidence, and the reducer refreshes What Worked/Failed, answered questions, carried-forward questions, ruled-out directions and Next Focus.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nMistral Vibe (vibe 3.1.2, installed) as a governed cli-external-orchestration runtime mode, and feature parity of its extensions, hooks, plugins, skills, commands and agents with cli-opencode. Work the eight angles in `research-angles.md`, one per iteration, using `research/evidence/vibe-help.txt` as the captured headless contract.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:key-questions -->\\n## 3. KEY QUESTIONS (remaining)\\n\\n- [ ] How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\\n- [ ] Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\\n- [ ] What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\n- [ ] For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\\n- [ ] What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:key-questions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Building any part of the `cli-mistral-vibe` mode. This run writes findings and a ranked phase plan only.\\n- Writing the operator's `~/.vibe/` directory or any credential value.\\n- Re-implementing Vibe features speculatively; every parity claim must name a Vibe source location or a live command capture.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- All eight research angles answered with cited evidence and a parity table, or `maxIterations` (8) reached.\\n- A hard blocker on the Vibe source (package not readable) makes the source-based angles `UNKNOWN`; record it and continue with the captured CLI contract.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\\n## 6. ANSWERED QUESTIONS\\n\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations answer questions]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:answered-questions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-worked -->\\n## 7. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-worked -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:what-failed -->\\n## 8. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:what-failed -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n\\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without success]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\\n## 10. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n[Approaches investigated and definitively eliminated]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:ruled-out-directions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\\n## 10A. SATURATED DIRECTIONS AND DIVERGENCE FRONTIER\\n\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Saturated: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:divergence-frontier -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\\n## 11A. CARRIED-FORWARD OPEN QUESTIONS\\n\\n[None yet]\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:carried-forward-open-questions -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n\\nAngle 1: headless dispatch contract - read the installed Vibe CLI entrypoint and headless runner, then confirm against `research/evidence/vibe-help.txt`.\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n## 12. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\nPopulated at init from the packet's own docs and the live install.\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Source pointers: installed package at `~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe` (version 3.1.2, console scripts `vibe`, `vibe-acp`, `vibe-app-server`); repo runtime packets under `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-*/`.\\n- Captured evidence: `specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt` (vibe 3.1.2 `--help`, `vibe-acp --help`, `vibe-app-server --help`).\\n- Packet context: `spec.md` (three phases, read-only research scope), `research-angles.md` (eight angles and the evidence rules), `plan.md`, `goal.md`.\\n- Integration points: `runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts` (nine executor kinds), `runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs` (command builders and model allowlists), `runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs` (state gateway), `.opencode/` plugin and agent surfaces.\\n- Constraints: read-only research; at most two live smoke dispatches shaped as a one-turn `OK` in a temp working directory; never read or print a key value.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. RESEARCH BOUNDARIES\\n\\n- Max iterations: 8\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.05\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Progressive synthesis: true\\n- research/research.md ownership: workflow-owned canonical synthesis output\\n- Lifecycle branches: `resume`, `restart` (live); `fork`, `completed-continue` (deferred)\\n- Machine-owned sections: reducer controls Sections 3, 6, 7-11A\\n- Question injection surface: `{spec_folder}/research/inbox.jsonl`\\n- Canonical pause sentinel: `research/.deep-research-pause`\\n- Current generation: 1\\n- Started: 2026-11-14T12:24:30Z\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deep-research-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794659079790,"end":1794659084403}}}}
