{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659228665,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0687f8002gJISY7TLE83k64","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da067a3f001Jgh4lUb309dLG2","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a31b75516ebe382d","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 1: headless dispatch contract\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All eight findings are new to this packet: the prompt sources, the flag matrix, the three output modes, the typed export, the five-value exit taxonomy, the denial behaviour, the launcher/app-server split and the JSON-RPC run server had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Python package as the CLI parser: launcher.py only execs the Rust binary\",\"Live vibe -p OK smoke dispatch without credentials: would test the config_error branch only\",\"--output json as the canonical machine record: export.json is the run record\"],\"focusTrack\":\"headless-contract\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/cli/launcher.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:26:39Z\",\"durationMs\":105000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"Headless mode is entered with -p/--prompt, with the prompt from the argument, stdin or --prompt-file; programmatic mode is mandatory for --agent-socket, and stdin-as-prompt is documented but not uniformly enforced.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"Dispatch flags cover model, agent profile, permissions, working directory and turn/time/price/token limits.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"--output selects text, json or streaming, and --output-dir additionally writes export.json plus a session journal copy on every exit.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"export.json is a typed run record carrying outcome, stop_reason, error, usage, cost_usd, steps, redacted config, limits, subagents and a computed exit_code.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"Exit codes are a fixed taxonomy: 0 finished, 1 usage/config error, 2 infrastructure failure, 3 any limit/termination/refusal, 4 aborted by an agent-socket server; --time-limit exits 3.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-006\",\"label\":\"A denied tool has no exit code of its own: headless runs cannot prompt for approval, so denial is a tool result and the run can still finish with exit 0.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-007\",\"label\":\"vibe is a thin launcher that execs a bundled Rust binary and points it at vibe-app-server; Rust owns the CLI and headless loop, Python owns the app server, journal and run export.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/cli/launcher.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-008\",\"label\":\"A second dispatch seam exists: --multiplex serves isolated harness connections in one stdio process, and a run-server command serves many headless runs over JSON-RPC with a live-run cap.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reading the Python package as the CLI parser\",\"reason\":\"launcher.py only execs the bundled Rust binary; Python is the app-server half\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Live smoke dispatch without credentials\",\"reason\":\"No ~/.vibe/config.toml or key; the run would exercise config_error (exit 1), not the dispatch path\",\"iteration\":1}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"--output json as the canonical machine record\",\"reason\":\"It is the response channel; export.json holds outcome, usage, cost, steps and exit_code\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"run\\\":1,\\\"