{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659342883,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da083aaf0020d1vVU2MieVkGq","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da083074001y36Gte1bMNZB0U","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a0ef70db9b5f7577","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"run\":2,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 2: providers, models and the subscription\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All eight findings are new: the two credential families, the declarative provider and model rows, the fetched model catalogue, reasoning as a model field rather than a flag, the Vibe Code budget counter, the plan-label mapping and the local cost record had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Reading ~/.vibe/config.toml or a key to confirm the live provider: no config exists and key values are out of scope\",\"Treating the model catalogue as a shipped roster: it is fetched from /model-catalog at runtime\"],\"focusTrack\":\"providers-and-billing\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/_defaults.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/platform_auth/_mistral.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/model_catalog/_constants.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/llm/reasoning.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_billing.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/setup/auth/whoami.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/evidence/vibe-config-schema.json\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:28:38Z\",\"durationMs\":119000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-001\",\"label\":\"Two credential families: a first-party mistral provider with browser sign-in (OIDC via console.mistral.ai) or MISTRAL_API_KEY, and BYOK providers with their own api_base and api_key_env_var; third-party credentials never reach first-party endpoints.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/_defaults.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/platform_auth/_mistral.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-002\",\"label\":\"Providers are declarative openai-style rows (api_base, api_key_env_var, api_style, backend, vertex project/region, extra_headers); only mistral and a local llamacpp endpoint ship by default.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-003\",\"label\":\"Models are declarative rows (name, provider, alias, temperature, thinking levels, prices, context length); pinning deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017 or zai-glm-5-3-flash is a provider row plus a model row each, and no roster ships beyond one default model.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-004\",\"label\":\"The Mistral model catalogue is fetched from <api_base>/model-catalog?surface=vibe-code with a 5s cap and 30-day TTL; BYOK providers rely only on declared rows.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/model_catalog/_constants.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-005\",\"label\":\"Reasoning effort has no dispatch flag: it is the per-model thinking field plus thinking_levels, so a governed executor pins it in the model row or agent profile.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/llm/reasoning.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-006\",\"label\":\"A Vibe turn draws on the org's monthly Vibe Code allowance, read from /v1/billing/budget with plan and pay-as-you-go from /v1/billing/subscription; both are optional and read as None when unavailable.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_billing.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-007\",\"label\":\"Plan labels come from /whoami: chat Free/Pro/Student/Team, Mistral Code Free Codestral/Code Enterprise, API Free API/PAYG API; the label is display data, the budget read is the counter.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/setup/auth/whoami.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter002-008\",\"label\":\"Per-dispatch cost is locally computable: export.json carries usage, cost_usd, steps and subagent costs, priced from the model row's per-million rates.\",\"iteration\":2,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reading ~/.vibe/config.toml or a key to confirm the live provider\",\"reason\":\"No config exists and key values are out of scope by the angle rule\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the model catalogue as a shipped roster\",\"reason\":\"It is fetched from /model-catalog at runtime with a 5s cap and 30-day cache\",\"iteration\":2}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Answering the OpenCode-versus-Vibe usage-counter comparison from client code\",\"reason\":\"Counter attribution is server-side; recorded UNKNOWN with the measurement that would settle it\",\"iteration\":2}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-002.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external