{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659425381,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0992060026Q8Chwgh0D35SZ","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da0984e8001xj3WT597uTY9yR","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8c6894beb2afc04","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 3: configuration and the repo-local runtime folder\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All eight findings are new: project config trust, the exact project discovery set, the layer stack, the two-level AGENTS.md surface, TOML agent profiles, skill path precedence, the global home tree and the repo mirror shape had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\