ype\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"Config layers are user-toml, user-supplied, project-toml, environment (VIBE_*) and overrides, plus an agent-profile layer barred from overriding the three credential-routing base URLs.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/layers/agent_profile.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"AGENTS.md is two-level: $VIBE_HOME/AGENTS.md as the user doc, project AGENTS.md collected walking up to the project root outermost-first, and subdirectory AGENTS.md injected lazily on file reads.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/system_prompt.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"Custom agents are TOML profiles in ~/.vibe/agents or discovered .vibe/agents, extended by agent_paths; default_agent defaults to accept-edits in both interactive and programmatic mode.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"Skills load from skill_paths plus .vibe/skills and .agents/skills with enabled/disabled glob or re: patterns, and the experimental registry mode lets project skills win name collisions.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-007\",\"label\":\"$VIBE_HOME is a fixed global tree (config.toml, AGENTS.md, .env, logs, worktrees, trusted_folders.toml, caches, history), so a repo mirror must live in .vibe/ rather than depend on home state.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_vibe_home.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-008\",\"label\":\"A .vibe/ mirror would hold config.toml, agents/*.toml, skills/, plugins/, prompts/ and tools/; OpenCode command markdown has no .vibe/commands counterpart and must become prompts or skills.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_local_config_files.py\",\".opencode\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Assuming a .vibe/commands directory\",\"reason\":\"It is absent from find_local_config_dirs; commands cannot be mirrored by file drop\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Assuming project config applies by presence\",\"reason\":\"ProjectConfigLayer requires trust; an untrusted repo config is inert\",\"iteration\":3}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Searching for a separate project plugin config file\",\"reason\":\"Plugin enablement lives in the same layered config.toml\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"run\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 3: configuration and the repo-local runtime folder\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All eight findings are new: project config trust, the exact project discovery set, the layer stack, the two-level AGENTS.md surface, TOML agent profiles, skill path precedence, the global home tree and the repo mirror shape had no prior capture.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\\\",\\\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\\\",\\\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\\",\\\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\\\",\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Assuming a .vibe/commands directory: absent from find_local_config_dirs\\\",\\\"Assuming project config applies by presence: ProjectConfigLayer requires trust\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"configuration\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_local_config_files.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_vibe_home.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/layers/project.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/layers/agent_profile.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/system_prompt.py\\\",\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\",\\\".opencode\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:30:02Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":84000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Project config is .vibe/config.toml, found by walking up parents to a trusted file; an untrusted project config is ignored unless --trust is passed.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/layers/project.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Project discovery is non-recursive and covers .vibe/tools, .vibe/skills, .vibe/plugins, .vibe/agents, .vibe/prompts, .vibe/config.toml and .agents/skills; there is no .vibe/commands.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_local_config_files.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Config layers are user-toml, user-supplied, project-toml, environment (VIBE_*) and overrides, plus an agent-profile layer barred from overriding the three credential-routing base URLs.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/layers/agent_profile.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"AGENTS.md is two-level: $VIBE_HOME/AGENTS.md as the user doc, project AGENTS.md collected walking up to the project root outermost-first, and subdirectory AGENTS.md injected lazily on file reads.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/system_prompt.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Custom agents are TOML profiles in ~/.vibe/agents or discovered .vibe/agents, extended by agent_paths; default_agent defaults to accept-edits in both interactive and programmatic mode.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\\\",\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Skills load from skill_paths plus .vibe/skills and .agents/skills with enabled/disabled glob or re: patterns, and the experimental registry mode lets project skills win name collisions.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"$VIBE_HOME is a fixed global tree (config.toml, AGENTS.md, .env, logs, worktrees, trusted_folders.toml, caches, history), so a repo mirror must live in .vibe/ rather than depend on home state.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_vibe_home.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"A .vibe/ mirror would hold config.toml, agents/*.toml, skills/, plugins/, prompts/ and tools/; OpenCode command markdown has no .vibe/commands counterpart and must become prompts or skills.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_local_config_files.py\\\",\\\".opencode\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Assuming a .vibe/commands directory\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"It is absent from find_local_config_dirs; commands cannot be mirrored by file drop\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Assuming project config applies by presence\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"ProjectConfigLayer requires trust; an untrusted repo config is inert\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Searching for a separate project plugin config file\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Plugin enablement lives in the same layered config.toml\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794659422726,"end":1794659425381}}}}
