{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659523616,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0b0bec00168KcGMh8nJEdjB","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da0b0042001ZBITOQ7yrssFhT","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-b269eacb64fa4ddb","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":4,\"run\":4,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 4: feature parity with cli-opencode\",\"findingsCount\":12,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All twelve findings and the twelve-row parity table are new: the OpenCode adapter's refusal of executable plugins, the seven hook types, and the per-surface verdicts and porting costs had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Packaging the repository's OpenCode JS plugins as a Vibe plugin: the adapter refuses executable OpenCode components\",\"Mapping session.compacted or session.idle onto post_agent: timing and payload differ\"],\"focusTrack\":\"parity\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_foreign.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_native.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\",\".opencode/plugins\",\".opencode/agents\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:31:42Z\",\"durationMs\":70000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-001\",\"label\":\"Executable OpenCode plugins have no Vibe equivalent: Vibe imports only portable skills and declarative MCP servers from an OpenCode package and never evaluates executables or custom tools.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_foreign.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/plugins/_native.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-002\",\"label\":\"Vibe declares seven hook types with strict blocking only for pre_tool, post_tool and pre_agent, declared in .vibe/hooks.toml or ~/.vibe/hooks.toml.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-003\",\"label\":\"The spec gate ports partially: a strict pre_tool hook can block a tool call, but it needs a hook script, a TOML declaration and a payload adapter.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\".opencode/plugins/system-spec-gate.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-004\",\"label\":\"Dispatch preflight hooks port partially through pre_tool and pre_agent, with per-dispatch state moved under .vibe/ or the packet.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\".opencode/plugins/cli-dispatch-audit.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-005\",\"label\":\"The session-relaunch loop has no equivalent: Vibe exposes no idle, compaction or resume hook, so a port needs an external supervisor reading export.json outcomes.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\".opencode/plugins/session-relaunch.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-006\",\"label\":\"Goal and context bridges are partial: AGENTS.md and .vibe/prompts cover context injection, but there is no goal-state surface.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/system_prompt.py\",\".opencode/plugins/opencode-goal.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-007\",\"label\":\"Slash commands have no equivalent: no .vibe/commands discovery exists, and .vibe/prompts is a prompt-template directory resolved by prompt id, not a user command catalogue with $ARGUMENTS.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/paths/_local_config_files.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/prompts/__init__.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-008\",\"label\":\"Custom agents are a partial match: Vibe TOML profiles carry display_name, description, safety, agent_type, instructions and overrides, so markdown+YAML agents need a renderer.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-009\",\"label\":\"Skills are equivalent: the same YAML-frontmatter markdown format parsed by parse_skill_markdown, discovered from skill_paths, .vibe/skills and .agents/skills, so pointing skill_paths at .skilled/skills is the cheapest port.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-010\",\"label\":\"MCP is equivalent through stdio/HTTP server config with static auth or OAuth; the repository's MCP routing plugin has no analogue but the server contract ports by config.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/auth/mcp_oauth.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-011\",\"label\":\"MCP Code Mode has no equivalent: the builtin tool set (bash, edit, grep, read_file, write_file, skill, task, todo, web_fetch, web_search, ask_user_question) contains no script or execute tool.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter004-012\",\"label\":\"Permissions have a partial equivalent through per-tool settings and approval agents with SAFE/NEUTRAL/DESTRUCTIVE/SMART/YOLO safety, while the self-invocation guard would be a strict pre_tool hook.\",\"iteration\":4,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/agents.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Packaging the repository's OpenCode JS plugins as a Vibe plugin\",\"reason\":\"The OpenCode adapter refuses executable plugins and custom tools by design\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Mapping session.compacted or session.idle onto post_agent\",\"reason\":\"Event timing and payload differ, so relaunch idempotency does not carry over\",\"iteration\":4}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Looking for a Vibe command-markdown directory\",\"reason\":\"None exists; .vibe/prompts resolves by prompt id, not user invocation\",\"iteration\":4}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-004.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"run\\\":4,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",