{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659601961,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0c446f001cbZOXR2yLsDvkm","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da0c3633001rxw2MoyAyb1e5w","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a37d8f2467600d3b","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":5,\"run\":5,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 5: skills, slash commands and subagents\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":0.95,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Nine findings are fully new (skill metadata, dual invocation, discovery order, registry skills, task tool, subagent caps, repository skill/command/agent mapping); one is partially new because it corrects the prior Code Mode verdict from none to equivalent.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Treating the absence of .vibe/commands as proof of no slash commands: user-invocable skills are the slash surface\",\"Reading the task tool as an unrestricted subagent dispatch: the default allowlist contains only explore\"],\"focusTrack\":\"skills-and-subagents\",\"edgeCase\":\"contradictory-evidence\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/manager.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/skill.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_session_peers.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/protocol.py\",\".opencode/commands\",\".skilled/skills\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:33:01Z\",\"durationMs\":47000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-001\",\"label\":\"Vibe skills are YAML frontmatter plus a markdown body with name (lowercase hyphen, max 64), description (max 1024), optional license, compatibility, metadata, allowed-tools, user-invocable and disable-model-invocation.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-002\",\"label\":\"Skills are model-invoked through the skill tool and user-invoked as /skill-name; user-invocable:false hides a skill from the slash menu and disable-model-invocation:true makes it user-only, so user-invocable skills are Vibe's slash commands.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/skill.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-003\",\"label\":\"Skill discovery order is skill_paths (global), then project .vibe/skills and .agents/skills, then user dirs, deduped by resolved path; the first claimant of a name wins and losers are reported shadowed.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/manager.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-004\",\"label\":\"Registry skills are opt-in: experimental_enable_registry_skills pulls versioned shared skills from Mistral with a latest alias and materialises them beside local skills.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-005\",\"label\":\"Subagents are the task(task, agent=explore) tool returning response, turns_used and completed, with a permission allowlist defaulting to explore and a denylist.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-006\",\"label\":\"The subagent roster is agent profiles with agent_type subagent, bounded by enable_subagents (true), max_subagents (32) and max_concurrent_subagents (32).\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-007\",\"label\":\"Repository skills map with near-zero effort by pointing skill_paths at .skilled/skills, since each is a SKILL.md with YAML frontmatter and extra keys are tolerated as metadata.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\".skilled/skills\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-008\",\"label\":\"Repository commands do not map one-to-one: OpenCode commands take $ARGUMENTS, while a Vibe user-invocable skill body has no documented argument placeholder.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\",\".opencode/commands\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-009\",\"label\":\"Repository agents map through a renderer: body to instructions, frontmatter to display_name/description/safety, subagent leaves get agent_type subagent plus a task allowlist entry, and main is a reserved name.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter005-010\",\"label\":\"Correction: Vibe has a Code Mode equivalent, the run_typescript runtime builtin whose program-made calls carry parent_call_id and reach tools and subagents as tools.*, superseding iteration 4's none verdict.\",\"iteration\":5,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_session_peers.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/protocol.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating the absence of .vibe/commands as proof of no slash commands\",\"reason\":\"User-invocable skills are the slash surface (/skill-name)\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Reading the task tool as an unrestricted subagent dispatch\",\"reason\":\"Its default allowlist contains only explore\",\"iteration\":5}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Searching the builtin tool directory for a Code Mode tool\",\"reason\":\"run_typescript lives in the Unified Harness runtime, not core/tools/builtins\",\"iteration\":5}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"run\\\":5,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 5: skills, slash commands and subagents\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":10,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.95,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Nine findings are fully new (skill metadata, dual invocation, discovery order, registry skills, task tool, subagent caps, repository skill/command/agent mapping); one is partially new because it corrects the prior Code Mode verdict from none to equivalent.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\\\",\\\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\\\",\\\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\\",\\\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\\\",\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Treating the absence of .vibe/commands as proof of no slash commands: user-invocable skills are the slash surface\\\",\\\"Reading the task tool as an unrestricted subagent dispatch: the default allowlist contains only explore\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"skills-and-subagents\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/manager.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/skill.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_session_peers.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/protocol.py\\\",\\\".opencode/commands\\\",\\\".skilled/skills\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:33:01Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":47000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Vibe skills are YAML frontmatter plus a markdown body with name (lowercase hyphen, max 64), description (max 1024), optional license, compatibility, metadata, allowed-tools, user-invocable and disable-model-invocation.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/parser.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Skills are model-invoked through the skill tool and user-invoked as /skill-name; user-invocable:false hides a skill from the slash menu and disable-model-invocation:true makes it user-only, so user-invocable skills are Vibe's slash commands.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/skill.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Skill discovery order is skill_paths (global), then project .vibe/skills and .agents/skills, then user dirs, deduped by resolved path; the first claimant of a name wins and losers are reported shadowed.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/manager.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Registry skills are opt-in: experimental_enable_registry_skills pulls versioned shared skills from Mistral with a latest alias and materialises them beside local skills.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Subagents are the task(task, agent=explore) tool returning response, turns_used and completed, with a permission allowlist defaulting to explore and a denylist.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The subagent roster is agent profiles with agent_type subagent, bounded by enable_subagents (true), max_subagents (32) and max_concurrent_subagents (32).\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Repository skills map with near-zero effort by pointing skill_paths at .skilled/skills, since each is a SKILL.md with YAML frontmatter and extra keys are tolerated as metadata.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\",\\\".skilled/skills\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Repository commands do not map one-to-one: OpenCode commands take $ARGUMENTS, while a Vibe user-invocable skill body has no documented argument placeholder.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/skills/models.py\\\",\\\".opencode/commands\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-009\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Repository agents map through a renderer: body to instructions, frontmatter to display_name/description/safety, subagent leaves get agent_type subagent plus a task allowlist entry, and main is a reserved name.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/builtins/task.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter005-010\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Correction: Vibe has a Code Mode equivalent, the run_typescript runtime builtin whose program-made calls carry parent_call_id and reach tools and subagents as tools.*, superseding iteration 4's none verdict.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/_session_peers.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/protocol.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Treating the absence of .vibe/commands as proof of no slash commands\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"User-invocable skills are the slash surface (/skill-name)\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Reading the task tool as an unrestricted subagent dispatch\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Its default allowlist contains only explore\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Searching the builtin tool directory for a Code Mode tool\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"run_typescript lives in the Unified Harness runtime, not core/tools/builtins\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":5}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-005.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794659599471,"end":1794659601961}}}}
