{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659778448,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0eef18001SASHYJ4GltuHz5","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da0ee208001m520eyzO3Q5mu7","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9d50042fe5be6ce9","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":6,\"run\":6,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 6: hooks and safety\",\"findingsCount\":10,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All ten findings are new: the hooks.toml declaration shape, the seven events and strict blocking set, hook provenance and protocols, runtime hook context, approval modes, the outside_workdir policy, protected-path escalation, the absence of a CLI sandbox mode, the eight-guard mapping and the turn-stopping gap had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Treating --auto-approve as a sandbox: it only suppresses prompts\",\"Porting completion-evidence as a blocking hook: post_agent has no strict mode\"],\"focusTrack\":\"hooks-and-safety\",\"edgeCase\":\"ambiguous-input\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/config.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/agents.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/vibe/_protected_paths.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/vibe/_sandbox.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:35:54Z\",\"durationMs\":173000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-001\",\"label\":\"Hooks are declared in .vibe/hooks.toml or ~/.vibe/hooks.toml as [[hooks]] entries with name, type, command, match, timeout (60s default), strict and description, stable with no opt-in flag.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/config.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/harness_files/_harness_manager.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-002\",\"label\":\"Seven hook events exist (post_agent, pre_tool, post_tool, pre_agent, notification, session_start, session_end); only pre_tool, post_tool and pre_agent accept strict, which is where a failing hook may block.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-003\",\"label\":\"Hook provenance spans host, project, project-plugin, global, global-plugin and client sources, and HookProtocol accepts VIBE, CLAUDE_CODE and KIMI_CODE.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-004\",\"label\":\"A resolved hook carries cwd, environment, order, visibility, protocol, plugin name and config file, enough to run a repository guard from its own checkout.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-005\",\"label\":\"Approval modes are agent safety levels SAFE, NEUTRAL, DESTRUCTIVE, SMART and YOLO, with builtin ask, accept-edits, smart-approve, auto-approve, explore and lean agents, and per-tool ALWAYS, NEVER or ASK permission.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/agents.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/agents/models.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/tools/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-006\",\"label\":\"The workspace boundary is a policy: outside_workdir is ask (default) or deny, overridable per tool, enable_auto_approve can forbid YOLO, and project config plus AGENTS.md are gated by folder trust.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/vibe_schema.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-007\",\"label\":\"Writes that would decide what executes next (.vibe config, .git/hooks, .git/config, shell startup files) escalate to a human; the module states it is a heuristic, not a boundary.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/vibe/_protected_paths.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-008\",\"label\":\"There is no user-facing sandbox mode in 3.1.2: no schema field and no CLI flag, while the harness ships a Sandbox Environment adapter, so sandboxing is a deployment choice.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/mistralai_vibe_local_harness/vibe/_sandbox.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-009\",\"label\":\"The eight enforcement guards port to pre_tool or post_tool strict hooks with a payload adapter and a state directory; the OpenCode tool.execute payload shape does not carry over.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter006-010\",\"label\":\"Turn-stopping guards cannot block on Vibe: completion-evidence and ask-surface-guard map to post_agent, which has no strict mode, and the goal/session adapters have no Vibe event.\",\"iteration\":6,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/hooks/models.py\",\".dsh/plugins/repo-guards/README.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Treating --auto-approve as a sandbox\",\"reason\":\"It suppresses prompts; containment is outside_workdir plus protected-path escalation\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Porting completion-evidence as a blocking hook\",\"reason\":\"post_agent has no strict mode, so the port is advisory only\",\"iteration\":6}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Searching the config schema for a sandbox mode\",\"reason\":\"No sandbox field exists; sandboxing is harness-level\",\"iteration\":6}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-006.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":6,\\\"run\\\":6,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 6: hooks and safety\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":10,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All ten findings are new: the hooks.toml declaration shape, the seven events and strict blocking set, hook provenance and protocols, runtime hook context, approval modes, the outside_workdir policy, protected-path escalation, the absence of a CLI sandbox mode, the eight-guard mapping and the turn-stopping gap had no prior capture.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe