{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659833605,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da0fce740011cOSmrWHv8L9Nt","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da0fc1ae001BxHBlBsgDEnsyt","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2027a2ee14d774d","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":7,\"run\":7,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 7: deep-loop executor support\",\"findingsCount\":9,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All nine findings are new: the two registration points, the builder-table entry, the env prefixes, the roster requirement, the alias-plus-thinking pair, the recursion guard, the three audit tables, the exit mapping and the stress fixture had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[],\"ruledOut\":[\"Mapping reasoningEffort to a Vibe flag: no such flag exists\",\"Guessing a VIBE_SESSION_ID env var: unobserved, and cli-devin omits rather than invents\"],\"focusTrack\":\"executor\",\"edgeCase\":\"missing-dependency\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:36:54Z\",\"durationMs\":60000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-001\",\"label\":\"A new kind registers in EXECUTOR_KINDS and the zod enum plus EXECUTOR_KIND_FLAG_SUPPORT; for Vibe the honest fields are model, sandboxMode, timeoutSeconds and liveTools, not reasoningEffort.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-002\",\"label\":\"The command builder is a LINEAGE_COMMAND_ADAPTERS entry: vibe -p prompt with --model alias, --agent profile, --output text, --output-dir, --max-turns, --time-limit, --workdir and --trust, stdin closed.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-003\",\"label\":\"The env allowlist is per kind; Vibe needs VIBE_ and MISTRAL_ prefixes or a dispatched run reports a missing credential, the same failure cli-pi records for LLMGATEWAY_.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-004\",\"label\":\"A closed model roster is mandatory because --model takes an alias config may not define; a VIBE_SUPPORTED_MODELS list plus isVibeModelAllowed follows the PI and DSH patterns.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-005\",\"label\":\"The roster must pair alias with expected thinking level: Vibe has no reasoning flag, so honouring the DeepSeek/GLM max pin requires a model row with thinking max and an executor that rejects other aliases.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/core/config/models.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-006\",\"label\":\"The recursion guard is generic: adding the kind to the dispatch-stack stamp makes vibe-dispatches-vibe refused before spawn, with no Vibe-specific code.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-007\",\"label\":\"Dispatch-audit recognition extends three tables: sandbox-is-OS-boundary false (no sandbox flag), web-search policy inherit (no switch), and no session-env entry until a Vibe session id variable is observed.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-008\",\"label\":\"Vibe's 0/1/2/3/4 exit taxonomy maps onto audit outcome classes, with 3 meaning stopped-without-finishing and therefore scoreable partial work, not success.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter007-009\",\"label\":\"Stress coverage needs one adapter fixture under runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter plus a receipt assertion beside the existing fan-out pwd, stderr, in-process prompt and audit receipt tests.\",\"iteration\":7,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Mapping reasoningEffort to a Vibe flag\",\"reason\":\"No such flag exists; the pin must live in the model row\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Guessing a VIBE_SESSION_ID env var for the session-env map\",\"reason\":\"Unobserved, and cli-devin deliberately omits rather than invents\",\"iteration\":7}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Looking for a per-kind sandbox flag in Vibe\",\"reason\":\"None exists; containment must be post-hoc\",\"iteration\":7}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-007.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":7,\\\"run\\\":7,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 7: deep-loop executor support\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":9,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All nine findings are new: the two registration points, the builder-table entry, the env prefixes, the roster requirement, the alias-plus-thinking pair, the recursion guard, the three audit tables, the exit mapping and the stress fixture had no prior capture.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\\\",\\\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\\\",\\\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\\",\\\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\\\",\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Mapping reasoningEffort to a Vibe flag: no such flag exists\\\",\\\"Guessing a VIBE_SESSION_ID env var: unobserved, and cli-devin omits rather than invents\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"executor\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"missing-dependency\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-config.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/tests/stress/cli-adapter\\\",\\\"~/.local