{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794659876840,"sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","part":{"partID":"prt_1da1074b8001gVOrs6HbeByOnd","sessionID":"ses_e25fd45d8ffe2Iv7ljplDZNbln","messageID":"msg_1da106744001Zyj01ALUZOlXyW","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-820e3458a021156a","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":8,\"run\":8,\"runId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Angle 8: ACP and other integration seams\",\"findingsCount\":8,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All eight findings are new: the ACP method surface, permission round-trips, session persistence and cancellation, the absent ACP export/exit contract, the three extra seams, the two dispatch contracts, the print-first recommendation and the four mechanics ACP would change had no prior capture.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\",\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\",\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\",\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\",\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"Adopting ACP as the first executor surface: needs a supervisor, completion signal and permission answerer before one iteration runs\",\"Using run-server now: the binary labels it experimental\"],\"focusTrack\":\"acp-and-seams\",\"edgeCase\":\"partial-success\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/utils.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/entrypoint.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-14T12:37:35Z\",\"durationMs\":41000,\"graphEvents\":[]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-001\",\"label\":\"ACP is a stdio JSON-RPC agent with initialize, authenticate, new_session, load_session, prompt, cancel and close_session; vibe-acp takes only -h, -v and --setup, so behaviour is protocol and config driven.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\",\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-002\",\"label\":\"ACP carries permission round-trips via client.request_permission with allow_once, allow_always, reject_once and reject_always, unlike print mode which denies a tool that needs approval.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/utils.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-003\",\"label\":\"ACP sessions are persistent and cancellable: new_session, load_session, close_session and cancel let one process hold many sessions, resume them and stop a turn without dying.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-004\",\"label\":\"ACP has no per-run exit taxonomy and no export.json; outcome, usage and cost are print-mode artifacts an ACP supervisor must reconstruct from protocol events.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-005\",\"label\":\"Three further seams exist: --output streaming for an event stream, --agent-socket for server-owned abort (exit 4), and run-server for many headless runs over JSON-RPC (experimental) with --runs-per-app-server.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-006\",\"label\":\"Print mode fits the existing executor contract with no new supervisor; ACP would need a persistent per-lineage client, a protocol-derived completion signal, a permission answerer, cancellation semantics and session-anchored receipts.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-007\",\"label\":\"Recommendation: print mode is the better first dispatch surface, ACP the better second one once a supervisor can answer permissions and resume, and run-server waits until it leaves experimental.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\",\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter008-008\",\"label\":\"ACP would change four fan-out mechanics: one process per lineage instead of per iteration, a new per-iteration completion record, a per-lineage permission answerer, and cancellation mapped onto existing signal handlers.\",\"iteration\":8,\"sources\":[\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\",\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Adopting ACP as the first executor surface\",\"reason\":\"Needs a supervisor, completion signal and permission answerer before one iteration runs\",\"iteration\":8}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Using run-server now\",\"reason\":\"The binary labels it experimental\",\"iteration\":8}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Looking for ACP flags to pin a model or workdir\",\"reason\":\"vibe-acp has no flags; those come from config or the session payload\",\"iteration\":8}\n","path":"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"run\\\":8,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-devpass-deepseek-1794658946949-yw45xe\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Angle 8: ACP and other integration seams\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":8,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":1.0,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"All eight findings are new: the ACP method surface, permission round-trips, session persistence and cancellation, the absent ACP export/exit contract, the three extra seams, the two dispatch contracts, the print-first recommendation and the four mechanics ACP would change had no prior capture.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"How does Vibe run one task non-interactively: which prompt source, flags, output formats and exit codes does the headless contract expose?\\\",\\\"Which providers, models and authentication paths can a Vibe dispatch use, and which usage counter does a turn draw on?\\\",\\\"What does Vibe read from the working directory and ~/.vibe/, and what would a generated repo-root .vibe/ mirror contain?\\\",\\\"For each cli-opencode surface this repository uses, does Vibe have an equivalent, a partial equivalent or none, and what would porting take?\\\",\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"What would a cli-mistral-vibe deep-loop executor kind need, and is ACP a better dispatch surface than print mode?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"Adopting ACP as the first executor surface: needs a supervisor, completion signal and permission answerer before one iteration runs\\\",\\\"Using run-server now: the binary labels it experimental\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"acp-and-seams\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"partial-success\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/utils.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/entrypoint.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\\\",\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-14T12:37:35Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":41000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"ACP is a stdio JSON-RPC agent with initialize, authenticate, new_session, load_session, prompt, cancel and close_session; vibe-acp takes only -h, -v and --setup, so behaviour is protocol and config driven.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\",\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"ACP carries permission round-trips via client.request_permission with allow_once, allow_always, reject_once and reject_always, unlike print mode which denies a tool that needs approval.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/utils.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"ACP sessions are persistent and cancellable: new_session, load_session, close_session and cancel let one process hold many sessions, resume them and stop a turn without dying.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"ACP has no per-run exit taxonomy and no export.json; outcome, usage and cost are print-mode artifacts an ACP supervisor must reconstruct from protocol events.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Three further seams exist: --output streaming for an event stream, --agent-socket for server-owned abort (exit 4), and run-server for many headless runs over JSON-RPC (experimental) with --runs-per-app-server.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/evidence/vibe-help.txt\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/_bin/vibe-rs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Print mode fits the existing executor contract with no new supervisor; ACP would need a persistent per-lineage client, a protocol-derived completion signal, a permission answerer, cancellation semantics and session-anchored receipts.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/lib/deep-loop/executor-audit.ts\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-007\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Recommendation: print mode is the better first dispatch surface, ACP the better second one once a supervisor can answer permissions and resume, and run-server waits until it leaves experimental.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\",\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/app_server/run_export.py\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter008-008\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"ACP would change four fan-out mechanics: one process per lineage instead of per iteration, a new per-iteration completion record, a per-lineage permission answerer, and cancellation mapped onto existing signal handlers.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/uv/tools/mistral-vibe/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vibe/acp/agent.py\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-run.cjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Adopting ACP as the first executor surface\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"Needs a supervisor, completion signal and permission answerer before one iteration runs\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Using run-server now\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The binary labels it experimental\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Looking for ACP flags to pin a model or workdir\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"vibe-acp has no flags; those come from config or the session payload\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":8}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/deltas/iter-008.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794659873976,"end":1794659876840}}}}
