caused the CLI to create `$VIBE_HOME` state: `~/.vibe/logs/vibe.log` (empty), `~/.vibe/logs/vibe-rs.log` (empty) and `~/.vibe/vibehistory` (\"Hello Vibe!\"). Two consequences:\n+\n+- **Executor requirement**: a `cli-mistral-vibe` kind must set `VIBE_HOME` to a lineage-local directory, exactly as the DSH runner gives each lineage a fresh home. Otherwise every dispatch writes into the operator's home and two concurrent lineages share history and logs.\n+- **Scope disclosure**: these three files were created outside this lineage's write surface by the CLI's own bootstrap and were left in place rather than deleted. No credential or prompt was written. Recorded in `iterations/iteration-002.md` under `## SCOPE VIOLATIONS`.\n+\n ## Eliminated Alternatives\n \n - Packaging `.opencode/plugins/*.js` as a Vibe plugin and expecting execution.\n - Mapping `session.compacted`/`session.idle` onto `post_agent`.\n","status":"modified","additions":7,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/research.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"3. **Hook count**: the binary changelog says \\\"three types\\\", the model declares seven. Resolution: stable core three (`post_agent`, `pre_tool`, `post_tool`) plus `pre_agent` and the host-fired `notification`/`session_start`/`session_end`.\\n4. **Skill precedence**: manager first-claimant order versus the registry-collision sentence. Unresolved; fixture named.\\n\\n## Late Finding (verification, outside the iteration stream)\\n\\nA second live observation is recorded here rather than in an iteration, because the loop closed at eight. Running the read-only `vibe config schema` caused the CLI to create `$VIBE_HOME` state: `~/.vibe/logs/vibe.log` (empty), `~/.vibe/logs/vibe-rs.log` (empty) and `~/.vibe/vibehistory` (\\\"Hello Vibe!\\\"). Two consequences:\\n\\n- **Executor requirement**: a `cli-mistral-vibe` kind must set `VIBE_HOME` to a lineage-local directory, exactly as the DSH runner gives each lineage a fresh home. Otherwise every dispatch writes into the operator's home and two concurrent lineages share history and logs.\\n- **Scope disclosure**: these three files were created outside this lineage's write surface by the CLI's own bootstrap and were left in place rather than deleted. No credential or prompt was written. Recorded in `iterations/iteration-002.md` under `## SCOPE VIOLATIONS`.\\n\\n## Eliminated Alternatives\", \"oldString\": \"3. **Hook count**: the binary changelog says \\\"three types\\\", the model declares seven. Resolution: stable core three (`post_agent`, `pre_tool`, `post_tool`) plus `pre_agent` and the host-fired `notification`/`session_start`/`session_end`.\\n4. **Skill precedence**: manager first-claimant order versus the registry-collision sentence. Unresolved; fixture named.\\n\\n## Eliminated Alternatives\", \"path\": \"specs/cli-external-orchestration/runtime-lifecycle/004-cli-mistral-vibe-creation/001-deep-research/research/lineages/devpass-deepseek/research.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794660019695,"end":1794660021143}}}}
